# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.tfvars
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example
*.tfplan
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Generated artifacts (rebuilt by tooling)
generated/
!generated/.gitkeep

# Secrets — never commit credentials
*.pem
*.key
.env
.tfstate-worktree/

# Agent worktrees. Parallel subagents each get an isolated checkout under
# .claude/worktrees/; they are transient scratch (64MB+ at a time) and their
# real output arrives as a branch, never as files in this tree.
.claude/
# MCP principal registry — operational configuration, not documentation.
# The committed template is mcp/principals.example.yaml.
mcp/principals.yaml
